'''Nahfahlaar''' is a red [[ON:Dragon|dragon]] who seeks to uphold Akatosh's will. To carry it out, he has allied himself with a reformed [[ON:Dragonguard|Dragonguard]] to help destroy [[ON:Laatvulon|Laatvulon]] and his [[ON:Order of the New Moon|New Moon Cult]], as well as to prevent [[ON:Kaalgrontiid|Kaalgrontiid]]'s ascension that would make him Akatosh's equal.
{{NewLeft}}

